              "summary": "Investigated the cause of the failed-jobs backlog and determined that connection refusals are due to the exhausted connection pool in pgbouncer. Restarting pgbouncer cleared the pool and resolved the issue. The backlog of failed jobs has been reduced by removing the connection refused errors.",
